    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιώσιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιόω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be lived</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					650
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ β. ἡμέραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					2.34
				</span></i>
			; esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ βιώσιμόν ἐστί
			τινι</span> 'tis not <i>meet</i> for him to <i>live</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί γὰρ μόνῃ μοι τῆσδ᾽ ἄτερ
			β.</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				566
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἂν ἦν βιώσιμα ἀνθρώποισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.109
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>likely to live</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.12.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.4.8
			</span></i>.</div>
